flowchart TD
    IMG[images/] --> MD[compute_metric_depth.py<br/>UniDepth]
    MD --> MDOUT[unidepth_disp/<br/>+ unidepth_intrins.json]

    IMG --> MOND[compute_depth.py<br/>Depth-Anything]
    MDOUT -.aligns to.-> MOND
    MOND --> ALN[aligned_depth_anything/]

    IMG --> SLAM[recon_with_depth.py<br/>DROID-SLAM]
    ALN --> SLAM
    MDOUT -.calib.-> SLAM
    SLAM --> POSES[droid_recon.npy<br/>camera poses + intrinsics]

    IMG --> TRK[compute_tracks_torch.py<br/>BootsTAPIR]
    MASKS[masks/] --> TRK
    TRK --> TRKS[bootstapir/<br/>2D point tracks + visibility]

    POSES --> READY[ready for training]
    ALN --> READY
    TRKS --> READY
    MASKS --> READY
